      "id": "file:src/hooks/useSteppedLayout.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "useSteppedLayout",
      "filePath": "src/hooks/useSteppedLayout.ts",
      "summary": "阶梯式（stepped）布局的核心 React hook，是整个 stepped 模式状态管理的入口。统一封装参数更新、槽位增删移动旋转、插入/复制/裁剪、分组管理（增删、高度、平滑、断开距离、激活、迁移、重排）、撤销历史、3D 预览生成/导出、桥接警告、全局优化提案生成与应用、以及 2D 分组轮廓预览。所有写操作都自动 push 历史快照并 invalidate 预览。",
      "tags": [
        "stepped",
        "hook",
        "state-management",
        "preview",
        "undo",
        "workspace"
      ],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "language": "typescript",
      "exportedSymbols": [
        "useSteppedLayout",
        "UseSteppedLayoutReturn"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/hooks/useSteppedLayout.ts:useSteppedLayout",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "useSteppedLayout",
      "filePath": "src/hooks/useSteppedLayout.ts",
      "summary": "阶梯式布局的主 hook，返回 params、所有槽位/分组/参数操作函数、有效尺寸、撤销栈、3D 几何与体积、预览状态、桥接警告、优化提案集以及轮廓预览。内部通过 useUndoHistory 管理快照、usePreviewLifecycle 驱动 worker 预览、useSteppedOutlinePreview 驱动轮廓预览，并用 ref + requestId 机制安全取消异步优化计算。",
      "tags": [
        "stepped",
        "hook",
        "state-management",
        "preview",
        "undo"
      ],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "language": "typescript"
    },
